contentText:
Taylor Swift received the inaugural Artist Director Honors at the 2026 MTV Video Music Awards Sunday night (Sept. 27), dedicating the win to her fans before having MTV broadcast the world premiere of her latest music video, &#8220;Patient Zero.&#8221;

